---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../lib/site';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Contact"
  description="Tip us off about a contractor, suggest a township to cover, or say hello."
>
  <section class="max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-6 pt-12 pb-20">
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-12 gap-x-10 gap-y-10">
      <div class="md:col-span-2">
        <p class="kicker">Tip the desk</p>
      </div>
      <div class="md:col-span-7">
        <h1 class="font-serif tracking-tight leading-[0.98] text-[40px] md:text-[64px]" style="font-weight: 400;">
          Send us the tip.<br/>
          <em class="not-italic text-brand">Or the horror story.</em>
        </h1>
        <p class="font-serif text-[20px] md:text-[22px] text-ink-soft mt-7 leading-[1.5] max-w-[52ch]" style="font-weight: 400;">
          A contractor we should look at. A township nobody covers. The renovation
          that taught you something painful. We read everything that comes in.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="border-t rule-strong mt-14"></div>
    <div class="border-t rule mt-[3px]"></div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-12 gap-x-10 gap-y-10 mt-12">
      <div class="md:col-start-3 md:col-span-3">
        <p class="kicker mb-3">Email</p>
        <a href="mailto:hello@renoklangvalley.my" class="font-serif text-[22px] underline underline-offset-[6px] decoration-1 decoration-ink/30 hover:decoration-ink" style="font-weight: 400;">hello@renoklangvalley.my</a>
        <p class="text-[13px] text-muted mt-3">Best for tips and corrections.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="md:col-span-3">
        <p class="kicker mb-3">Instagram</p>
        <a href={SITE.social.instagram} class="font-serif text-[22px] underline underline-offset-[6px] decoration-1 decoration-ink/30 hover:decoration-ink" rel="me noopener" style="font-weight: 400;">@renoklangvalley</a>
        <p class="text-[13px] text-muted mt-3">DMs read on Wednesdays.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="md:col-span-3">
        <p class="kicker mb-3">Editor</p>
        <p class="font-serif text-[22px]" style="font-weight: 400;">{SITE.author.name}</p>
        <p class="text-[13px] text-muted mt-3">{SITE.author.role} — Selangor.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="border-t rule mt-16"></div>
    <p class="text-[13px] text-muted mt-6 max-w-[52ch] leading-relaxed">
      We don’t do paid placements, sponsored reviews, or guest posts with backlinks.
      Pitching us one is genuinely the fastest way to be politely ignored.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
